aurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ZGznjpkqi6a_It4lAgCnYw","review_id":"VWTDr-_55MxWD8tPevNabA","date":"2019-05-16T13:43:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9405210018157959,"text_excerpt":"I had the burrito bowl which was really delicious. I would recommend eating here. Everything taste fresh and delicious."},{"business_id":"ZGznjpkqi6a_It4lAgCnYw","review_id":"Xz0iGLxdy7Th_TiqQB4S9A","date":"2015-09-28T03:30:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9282212853431702,"text_excerpt":"I tried the one in Metairie a few years ago before this one opened and it was pretty suck-tacular, but one day I was feeling really lazy and remembered that this place is right down the street. I asked about sizes of the burritos, and the friendly people working assured me that a Regular Misdemeanor (the smallest) was more than enough food for most people. Surprisingly, it was for me, and I consider myself to be a pretty hearty eater. The rice was seasoned nicely, the beans were beans, but what stood out the most was their steak: they were juicy, nice sized cubes that were cooked and seasoned perfectly. Some places give you what seem like steak niblets so this was a nice change. They have..."},{"business_id":"ZGznjpkqi6a_It4lAgCnYw","review_id":"kew7Tt8Chjfn4DdO4h_HXA","date":"2018-04-30T02:11:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9275681972503662,"text_excerpt":"I'm reading these reviews and I disagree with the bad ones. If you liked most of everything except the rice, it shouldn't warrant one star. Okay, so on to my review. I've eaten here about 5 times. I usually get the nachos which I like very much. Today, I got a burrito. I had a choice of 4 kinds of tortillas which is nice. Also a good selection of beans, meats and vegetables. I don't find the upcharge on the guacamole to be too expensive and most other places also charge more for guacamole. When I got home and began to eat my burrito, everything was good, but the rice was kind of crunchy. I called and was told by a lovely young lady, Crystal, I could come in for a refund or another burrito..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZGznjpkqi6a_It4lAgCnYw","photo_id":"Zq2Dl6NG10c7t-7f-00Czw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Zq2Dl6NG10c7t-7f-00Czw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8927490711212158},{"business_id":"ZGznjpkqi6a_It4lAgCnYw","photo_id":"LQxNA6x1l8TGjzdeHWPw1Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LQxNA6x1l8TGjzdeHWPw1Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8147381544113159},{"business_id":"ZGznjpkqi6a_It4lAgCnYw","photo_id":"sM1yQOunODXUHyJk66lY0Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/sM1yQOunODXUHyJk66lY0Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.804454505443573},{"business_id":"ZGznjpkqi6a_It4lAgCnYw","photo_id":"PIbWG68FSW08ltzridn0EA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/PIbWG68FSW08ltzridn0EA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8024800419807434},{"business_id":"ZGznjpkqi6a_It4lAgCnYw","photo_id":"iy7OcVlb-BYNg_GaHosQPQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/iy7OcVlb-BYNg_GaHosQPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.678727388381958}]},"notebook_case":null}
